{"id":"vod_bf_41111","vodId":"41111","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"亚尔斯兰战记","name_cn":"亚尔斯兰战记","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/77ea89309db884fbc787ac39f611b788.jpg"},"summary":"没有人能够想到，曾经强极一时的帕尔斯王国，竟然也有濒临崩溃的一天。蛮族鲁西达尼亚的骚扰让王国中战事不断，与此同时，万骑长出人意料的背叛让帕尔斯王国的军队在亚特罗帕提尼会战中遭遇惨败溃不成军。　　亚尔斯兰（小林裕介 配音）是帕尔斯王国的王子，即使个性软弱，善良细腻，但他终究还是要背负起复国的责任。在孔武有力忠贞不二的达龙（细谷佳正 配音）的保护下，亚尔斯兰免于了被俘虏的命运，两人决定前往巴休尔山，寻找在那里隐居的智者那尔撒斯（浪川大辅 配音），那尔撒斯和亚尔斯兰的父亲曾经有过一段并不愉快的过去，如今，面对哀求的亚尔斯兰，他是否会不计前嫌，伸出援手？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:00:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaersilanzhanji/第14集/